=========================
Classic Warclient Ruleset
=========================

This is Warciv's competitive variant of Freeciv's classic ruleset. It keeps
the familiar classic game while restoring and extending Warclient-style play.

Highlights
----------

- Four base trade routes per city with Warclient-style recurring revenue
- Civ I/II-style research costs
- Square city radius and matching city vision
- Rapture-oriented city management presets
- Classic settler population costs and competitive terrain timings
- Support for Warciv's automatic caravan planning

The accompanying ``classic-warclient-competitive.serv`` profile supplies the
recommended map and server settings, including archipelago-shaped islands,
independent lake and river density, and increased natural resources.

From a build directory, launch the server with:

  ./run.sh freeciv-server --read ../data/classic-warclient-competitive.serv

Or select the ruleset alone with:

  /ruleset classic-warclient
